# NOT api/recon/__tests__/fixtures/ — those are COMMITTED.
# They are a hand-captured snapshot of public GitHub data for fastify/fastify
# with no generator script, so ignoring them meant production-data.test.ts
# could only ever run on the one machine that happened to have them, and would
# have been unreproducible if that disk died. ~412KB, no secrets.
